WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Oil sands operations contribute significant carbon emissions in Canada. So the six largest companies have teamed up to make strides on the path to NetZero. Investing in technology and innovation. Already cut emissions an average 22% per barrel. Working with governments to create and protect jobs. Developing one of the world's largest carbon capture and storage facilities. Our NetZero plan is in motion and we're making progress on multiple pathways. See our plan in action at pathwaysalliance.ca
加拿大油砂开采产生了大量的碳排放，因此六家最大的公司联手在通往净零排放的道路上大步迈进。我们投资于技术和创新，每桶碳排放量已经平均减少了22%，并与政府合作创造和保护就业岗位，开发全球最大的碳捕集与封存设施之一。我们的净零计划正在实施中，我们正通过多种途径取得进展。请访问pathwaysalliance.ca查看我们的实际计划。

2
00:00:30.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Music Our episodes deal with serious and often distressing incidents. If you feel at any time you need support, please contact your local crisis centre. For suggested phone numbers for confidential support, please see the show notes for this episode on your app or on our website. Today's episode deals with a crime committed against a child. It won't be suitable for all listeners. Music 11 year old Shauna Howe looked forward to Halloween every year.
音乐 我们的节目涉及严重且往往令人痛苦的事件。如果您在任何时候觉得需要支持，请联系当地的危机中心。有关保密支持的建议电话号码，请查看您应用程序上或我们网站上的本集节目说明。今天的节目涉及针对儿童的犯罪，并不适合所有听众。音乐 11岁的肖娜·豪每年都盼望着万圣节的到来。

3
00:01:14.000 --> 00:02:05.000
She was enthralled by the spooky decorations, scary stories and costume parties that started a full week before the holiday. Culminating in the most exciting event of all. Trick or treating on the night of October 31st. In late October 1992, like every other town in America, Oil City in northern Pennsylvania's Venango County was preparing for Halloween. Oil City sits on a bend of the Allegheny River at the mouth of Oil Creek, about an hour and a half north of Pittsburgh. As its name suggests, the city was founded on the nearby oil fields and the wealth that came with the oil boom, and later, the steel industry. At its peak, the town boasted a population of 22,000 residents, with job seekers attracted by the thriving employment prospects.
她深深迷恋那些在假期前整整一周就开始出现的幽灵装饰、恐怖故事和化妆派对，并在最令人兴奋的活动中达到高潮——10月31日晚上的不给糖就捣蛋。1992年10月下旬，就像美国其他所有城镇一样，位于宾夕法尼亚州北部韦南戈县的石油城正在筹备万圣节。石油城坐落在阿勒泰尼河的一处河曲上，位于油溪口，在匹兹堡以北大约一个半小时车程的地方。顾名思义，这座城市建立在附近的油田以及石油繁荣带来的财富之上，后来又发展了钢铁工业。在其鼎盛时期，该镇曾拥有22000名居民，繁荣的就业前景吸引了许多求职者。

4
00:02:05.000 --> 00:03:08.000
But after being hit hard by the collapse of the steel industry, Oil City became the poster child for the Rust Belt. Locals calculated the decline in Oil City's population by reference to each closing gas station. The town offered a cheap cost of living, but gainful employment became scarce. As factories moved and entire industries were shifted offshore, jobs and people followed. The town had little to offer young people, many of whom dropped out of school and became trapped in a cycle of poverty. Those who grew up and moved away often never came back. On the morning of Tuesday, October 27, 1992, Lucy listened as her young daughter Shauna chatted about her upcoming plans as she prepared herself for the day ahead. That afternoon, Shauna intended to go straight from Seventh Street School to the local nursing home where she would join her Girl Scout troop in singing to the elderly residents.
但在遭受钢铁工业崩溃的沉重打击之后，石油城成了铁锈地带的典型代表。当地人通过参考每一家倒闭的加油站来计算石油城人口的下降。该镇的生活成本很低，但谋生工作却变得稀缺。随着工厂搬迁和整个产业转移到海外，工作岗位和人口也随之流失。这个小镇几乎没有什么能提供给年轻人的，其中许多人辍学并陷入了贫困的恶性循环。那些长大后搬走的人往往再也没有回来。1992年10月27日星期二早晨，露西听着她的小女儿肖娜在为新的一天做准备时，叽叽喳喳地聊着她接下来24小时的计划。那天下午，肖娜打算直接从第七街学校去当地的疗养院，加入她的女童军小分队，为老年居民唱歌。

5
00:03:08.000 --> 00:04:49.000
Shauna sang in the children's choir at church so she was looking forward to performing for the senior citizens, but she was most excited about what was to follow. After the performance, she planned to head to the first free Methodist Church for a Halloween party. The Howe family didn't have the money for Shauna to spend on an elaborate fancy dress costume, so the 11-year-old improvised. She decided to dress up as a gymnast, wearing a turquoise bodysuit with black stripes, tights, sneakers and soft satin-y gloves that stretched up above her elbows. As she would not have time to come home after school to change outfits, she wore the leotard underneath her regular clothes. The 400 block of West First Street where Shauna lived with her mother, stepfather, 12-year-old brother and 5-year-old sister was in one of the poorer areas of the town. Nevertheless, it was regarded as safe by residents who rarely worried about locking their houses or cars, and Lucy had no hesitation in letting her daughter make her own way to and from school. Navigating the familiar streets at night time was different as Shauna was afraid of the dark, so her mother would arrange to have someone pick her up after the Halloween party that evening.
肖娜在教堂的儿童唱诗班唱歌，所以她很期盼为老年人表演，但她最兴奋的是接下来的活动。表演结束后，她计划前往第一自由卫理公会教堂参加万圣节派对。豪家没有多余的钱让肖娜买一件精美的化装服，于是这个11岁的女孩即兴发挥。她决定扮成一名体操运动员，穿着一件带有黑色条纹的蓝绿色紧身连衣裤、紧身裤、运动鞋以及长到手肘以上的柔软缎面手套。由于放学后没有时间回家换衣服，她把紧身衣穿在了便服里面。肖娜和她的母亲、继父、12岁的哥哥以及5岁的妹妹居住在西第一街400号，这里是该镇较贫困的地区之一。尽管如此，居民们仍认为这里很安全，他们很少担心锁房子或锁车，露西也毫不犹豫地让女儿自己上下学。在夜间穿过熟悉的街道则有所不同，因为肖娜怕黑，所以她的母亲会安排人在那天晚上的万圣节派对结束后接她。

6
00:04:49.000 --> 00:06:29.000
Later that night, Lucy was working her regular shift at a pizza shop in the nearby town of Franklin when she called home to check in on her family. Her de facto partner, John Brown, told her Shauna still hadn't arrived home from the Halloween party. Lucy realized she had forgotten to arrange someone to pick her daughter up from the event, but was reassured by the fact the church was only a short half-mile walk away from their block along familiar streets that Shauna had travelled many times before. By 8.30pm, long past the time she was expected to return, Shauna still hadn't arrived home. John didn't have the phone numbers of the friends she may have walked home with, and unable to contact anyone, he jumped into his car and drove the route she would have most likely taken, expecting to spot her along the way. Although there were a couple of different routes from the church to their home, John was certain Shauna would have stuck to the main roads. Failing to find her walking the streets, John progressed to the first free Methodist church where the Halloween celebrations were taking place, only to realize the party had long since finished and all the other Girl Scouts had already gone home. Although Shauna could be headstrong, she was otherwise obedient and not the type to take off to a friend's house without letting someone know, so John continued to scout the nearby streets expecting to find her.
那天晚些时候，露西正在附近富兰克林镇的一家比萨店值常规班，她打电话回家了解家里情况。她的事实婚姻伴侣约翰·布朗告诉她，肖娜还没从万圣节派对回家。露西意识到她忘了一劳永逸地安排人去活动现场接女儿，但转念一想，教堂距离他们所在的街区只有短短半英里路程，而且都是肖娜以前走过很多次的熟悉街道，这让她感到安心。到了晚上8点30分，早过了她预期返回的时间，肖娜依然没有到家。约翰没有那些可能和她一起走回家的朋友的电话号码，在无法联系到任何人的情况下，他跳上车，沿着她最可能走的路线开去，希望能一路上找到她。虽然从教堂到他们家有几条不同的路线，但约翰确信肖娜一定会走主路。在街上没有找到她后，约翰继续前往万圣节庆祝活动举办的第一自由卫理公会教堂，结果却发现派对早已结束，其他女童军也都已经回家了。虽然肖娜有时有些顽固，但她平时很听话，不是那种不打招呼就跑到朋友家去的人，于是约翰继续在附近的街道上搜寻，希望能找到她。

7
00:06:29.000 --> 00:07:43.000
After exhausting the search of the neighborhood, John returned home to find Shauna hadn't returned during his absence. At 9.30pm, Lucy found home again and suggested her daughter maybe at the home of her former husband, Shauna's father, Robert Howe. Although the ex-husband and wife had a tumultuous relationship, their four children remained close to their father, with Shauna's nine-year-old sister living with him in a neighboring town. Lucy contacted Robert, who swore Shauna was not with him. Unsure whether to believe him, Lucy finished her shift and rushed home. Upon her arrival, she called the parents of Shauna's best friend, Joyeel, who was a member of the same Girl Scout group. Joyeel confirmed Shauna had been at the church Halloween party and explained that when it ended, the two girls set off together in the same direction at around 8pm. When they reached the point where they needed to part ways to head towards their respective homes, Shauna expressed that she was afraid to walk in the dark and asked Joyeel to walk with her.
在精疲力竭地搜寻了整个社区后，约翰回到家，发现肖娜在他离开期间并没有回来。晚上9点30分，露西再次打通了家里的电话，并建议女儿可能在前夫、肖娜的生父罗伯特·豪的家里。尽管这位前夫和前妻的关系曾经很动荡，但他们的四个孩子和父亲依然很亲近，肖娜9岁的妹妹就和父亲住在邻近的一个镇上。露西联系了罗伯特，罗伯特发誓肖娜并不在他那里。由于不确定是否该相信他，露西结束了当天的班次，急忙赶回家中。一到家，她就打电话给肖娜最好的朋友乔伊尔的父母，乔伊尔和肖娜属于同一个女童军小组。乔伊尔证实肖娜确实去过教堂的万圣节派对，并解释说派对结束后，两个女孩在大约晚上8点时朝着同一个方向一起出发了。当她们走到需要分头走向各自家里的路口时，肖娜表示她害怕在黑暗中行走，并请求乔伊尔陪她一起走。

8
00:07:43.000 --> 00:08:58.000
Joyeel suggested that they instead go back to her place and from there her father would walk Shauna safely home. Shauna declined the offer, saying, no, that's alright, before heading off alone on the ten-minute walk towards her home. By 10pm, Shauna had not been heard from for two hours, prompting her mother to call the police and report the 11-year-old as missing. At the time of Lucy's call, oil city police were in the midst of investigating an odd occurrence that had been reported earlier that night. At 8.06pm, local resident Dan Paydon had been walking along Reed Street, a leafy suburban neighbourhood lined with residential houses, when he sighted a young girl dressed in a top-and-shorts walking alone down West 1st Street. She was approaching the Reed Street intersection in front of a medical centre across the road from the Presbyterian Church. A tall, thin, scruffy-looking man wearing an army jacket and baseball cap was walking in the same direction on the opposite sidewalk, smoking a cigarette.
乔伊尔建议她们改道去她家，然后由她父亲送肖娜安全回家。肖娜拒绝了这个提议，说了声“不，没关系”，然后独自一人踏上了回家的十分钟路程。到了晚上10点，已经有两个小时没有肖娜的音讯了，这促使她的母亲打电话报警，将这名11岁的女孩报告为失踪人口。在露西打电话时，石油城警方正在调查当晚早些时候报告的一起诡异事件。晚上8点06分，当地居民丹·佩登正沿着里德街步行，这是一条绿树成荫、两旁都是住宅的郊区街道，这时他看到一个穿着上衣和短裤的小女孩独自沿着西第一街走着。她正走近马路对面长老会教堂前方的医疗中心前的里德街十字路口。一个身材高大、消瘦、衣着邋遢、戴着军用夹克和棒球帽的男子正走在对面的行人道上，抽着烟。

9
00:08:58.000 --> 00:10:02.000
Dan observed the man cross to the other side of the road before appearing to scoop the girl up and run around the corner. Seconds later, he heard a muffled scream. Dan ran towards the intersection and witnessed a small, boxy, dark red sedan vehicle speed away. It looked to be an Oldsmobile with Pennsylvania State license plates, but it moved too quickly for Dan to catch the plate number. Although he hadn't seen the man put the girl in the car, both he and the girl were now gone. Dan immediately began banging on the doors of nearby houses until a woman answered before frantically telling her, I've just seen a little girl kidnapped and I need to call the police. As no one had reported a missing child at the time, police were unsure whether Dan had witnessed an abduction or simply a father picking up his errant child. But the phone call from Lucy later that night confirmed the worst-case scenario.
丹看到那名男子穿过马路，随后似乎把女孩抱起来，绕过了街角。几秒钟后，他听到了一声闷闷不乐的尖叫。丹向十字路口跑去，亲眼看到一辆小型的、方头方脑的深红色轿车加速驶离。这看起来像是一辆挂有宾夕法尼亚州车牌的奥兹莫比尔汽车，但它开得太快，丹没能看清车牌号。虽然他没有看到男子把女孩塞进车里，但现在他和女孩都已经不见了。丹立即开始敲击附近房屋的房门，直到一位妇女应门，他惊慌失措地告诉她：“我刚刚看到一个小女孩被绑架了，我需要报警。”由于当时没有人报告儿童失踪，警方不确定丹目睹的是一起绑架案，还是仅仅是一位父亲在接他调皮的孩子。但露西当晚晚些时候打来的电话证实了最糟糕的情况。

10
00:10:02.000 --> 00:11:37.000
The Reed and West First intersection was a couple of blocks from Shawna House home, and if Dan Payden's recollections were factual, it appeared the child had been snatched whilst walking home. The oil city police set up a roadblock on the road leading out of town and informed every police station within a 99-mile radius of the situation unfolding. Local officers came to the area by patrol car and on foot and paid a visit to the home of Shawna's father, Robert Howe, to confirm the girl wasn't there. Seeing the unusual police activity around the typically quiet streets, locals soon joined in on the search for Shawna. By late morning, word had spread throughout town that Shawna Howe was missing, prompting hundreds of volunteers to comb the streets into nearby forests looking for any signs of the child. With police considering the possibility that Shawna may have been kidnapped for ransom, her mother remained housebound in case the perpetrators made contact, helplessly pacing back and forth awaiting any news. State troopers door-knocked along the route it was believed Shawna had taken the night prior, asking residents whether they had seen anything suspicious. But other than Dan Payden, no one had. Detectives were not convinced Dan was a particularly reliable witness, as there were elements of his story that didn't quite add up.
里德街和西第一街的十字路口距离肖娜家只有几个街区，如果丹·佩登的回忆属实，这个孩子显然是在回家路上被强行掳走的。石油城警方在通往城外的道路上设置了路障，并将这一突发情况通知了方圆99英里内的每一个警察局。当地警员乘巡逻车和步行赶到该地区，并造访了肖娜生父罗伯特·豪的家，以确认女孩不在那里。看到这个通常安静的街道周围出现罕见的警察活动，当地人很快也加入了寻找肖娜的行列。到了深夜，肖娜·hu失踪的消息已经在镇上传开，这促使数百名志愿者梳理街道，并进入附近的森林寻找孩子的任何踪迹。由于警方考虑到肖娜可能被绑架索要赎金的可能性，她的母亲一直呆在家中，以防绑匪联系她，她无助地来回踱步，等待着任何消息。州骑警沿着据信肖娜前一天晚上的路线逐户敲门，询问居民是否看到任何可疑情况。但除了丹·佩登之外，没有人看到过。侦探们并不确信丹是一个特别可靠的证人，因为他的故事中有些部分不太对劲。

11
00:11:37.000 --> 00:13:09.000
If he had seen the girl being taken, the question remained as to why he didn't try to intervene or stop the perpetrator from getting away. A suspicious eye was cast on Dan himself, who was questioned several times by police, but remained steadfast about his version of events. The next day, October 29, a search party led by Shawna's uncle Keith decided to take their efforts into the wooded area bordering Oil City. They headed in a southerly direction along Big Egypt Road towards Cranberry Township, before moving into the 60 acres of woodland of Waltonian Park. They then ventured seven and a half miles south of Oil City to the Rockland Township, heading out to Coulter's Hole, a secluded swimming and camping spot popular with fishermen, hunters and picnickers. At night, the area was frequented by teens participating in underage drinking and drug-taking, while the Oil City chapter of the Kingsman Biker Club was also known to use the location as a party spot. Upon reaching Coulter's Hole, Keith and his search party split up to cover more ground, but it wasn't long before he was being called to check something out. A searcher was crossing a long deserted railway bridge that overlooked the forest when he peered over the rail and spotted a flash of colour that looked like a piece of children's clothing.
如果他真的看到女孩被带走，问题仍然在于为什么他没有试图干预或阻止作案者逃跑。警方对丹本人产生了怀疑，并对他进行了多次盘问，但他对自己的事件版本始终坚定不移。第二天，即10月29日，由肖娜的叔叔基思带队的一支搜寻队决定将搜寻范围扩大到石油城边缘的林区。他们沿着大埃及路向南朝克兰berry镇方向前进，然后进入华尔特尼安公园60英亩的林地。接着，他们向南探险，来到距离石油城七英里半的罗克兰镇，前往库尔特深潭，这是一个深受渔民、猎人和野餐者欢迎的偏僻游泳和露营地。到了晚上，这个地区经常有参与未成年饮酒和吸毒的青少年光顾，而石油城国王人摩托车俱乐部的分会也众所周知将此地用作派对场所。一到达库尔特深潭，基思和他的搜寻队员便分散开来以扩大搜寻范围，但没过多久，他就被叫去查看情况。一名搜寻队员正走过一座俯瞰森林的荒废已久的铁路桥，他探头向栏杆外望去，瞥见了一抹彩色的闪光，看起来像是一件儿童衣物。

12
00:13:09.000 --> 00:14:59.000
When Keith joined the man on the bridge, he felt sick. The item that lay far below matched the description of the turquoise bodysuit Shauna had worn as part of her gymnast costume on the night she vanished. Police brought Shauna's stepfather, John Brown, to the scene, who confirmed the item of clothing belonged to his stepdaughter. A large-scale police search of the area commenced with assistance from a mass of volunteers, including members of Shauna's extended family. Despite their efforts, nothing else of significance was found. Flyers featuring Shauna's picture were distributed throughout town, describing her as five foot tall, weighing 78 pounds with straight brown hair, blue eyes, one scar behind her right ear, and another in the middle of her forehead. Her mother Lucy appeared on local television pleading for the safe release of her daughter, while her stepfather fronted the press, saying, It's hard holding on, but you've got to do it, because that's the only thing we have. At approximately 9am the following morning of October 30, just 500 yards from the location where Shauna's bodysuit was found, a man who had been camping at Coulter's Hole was walking in a desolate area underneath an abandoned Trestle railway bridge. As he navigated alongside the dry, rocky creekbed, he saw the body of a young girl lying face down between a rock and a log. She was dressed in shorts, knee-high socks, and a short-sleeved shirt which was inside out and back to front.
当基思和那名男子汇合在桥上时，他感到胃里一阵翻江倒海。下方远处的那个物品与肖娜失踪当晚作为体操运动员服装一部分所穿的那件蓝绿色紧身连衣裤的描述完全相符。警方将肖娜的继父约翰·布朗带到现场，他确认这件衣物属于他的继女。在大量志愿者（包括肖娜的家属）的协助下，警方对该地区展开了大规模搜寻。尽管他们作出了努力，但没有发现其他有价值的东西。印有肖娜照片的传单在全镇分发，描述她身高五英尺，体重78磅，留着直直的棕色头发，蓝眼睛，右耳后有一道疤痕，额头中间还有另一道疤痕。她的母亲露西出现在当地电视台，恳求安全释放她的女儿，而她的继父则面对媒体说：“坚持下去很难，但你必须这样做，因为这是我们仅有的东西。”在第二天（10月30日）上午9点左右，距离发现肖娜紧身衣的位置仅500码远的地方，一名在库尔特深潭露营的男子正在一座废弃的桁架铁路桥下方荒凉的区域散步。当他在干燥多石的小溪河床旁行走时，他看到一个年轻女孩的尸体面朝下躺在一块岩石和一根圆木之间。她穿着短裤、过膝袜以及一件里外穿反、前后穿反的短袖衬衫。

13
00:14:59.000 --> 00:16:12.000
